          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/inside_sj_1.jpg",
            "caption": "SOURCING",
            "heading": "the diamonds",
            "text": "<p>Shamballa Jewels' diamonds are sourced with consideration and care with zero tolerance policy in regards to conflict diamonds. Through collaboration with trusted diamond suppliers, Shamballa Jewels makes sure to support and follow the internationally agreed Kimberley Process. The Kimberley Process is an initiative to block the flow of conflict blood diamonds, and only support the purchase of rough, conflict-free diamonds from trusted, respectful sources whose standards also strictly follow the Kimberley Process declaration.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_fWezJV": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/inside_sj_6.jpg",
            "caption": "CRAFTING",
            "heading": "the cufflinks",
            "text": "<p>From the moment we ethically source our diamonds to the final touch of our master craftsmen, the journey of creating each of our cufflinks is a testament to uncompromising quality and artistry. Selected for their radiant brilliance, our diamonds are meticulously hand-set onto our cufflinks crafted from 18K gold by skilled jewelry craftsmen, melding the lustrous sheen of precious metal with the sparkling allure of nature's finest gemstones. The result is radiant cufflinks, shimmering with every facet and gleam.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_GwHWaG": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/inside_sj_cuffs_1.jpg",
            "caption": "UNPARALLELED",
            "heading": "design",
            "text": "<p>Our collection of cufflinks includes a variety of stylish designs, from classic and timeless to modern and innovative. Whether you desire simple, elegant cufflinks for the office or eye-catching designs for a festive occasion, you will find the perfect choice with us. Each cufflink is crafted to highlight your unique style and add character to your look.</p>",
